 "remarks": "Charming Colonial, lovingly updated boasts three bedrooms and three full baths plus a powder room all recently renovated with heated floors. Home office conveniently located off updated eat in kitchen with granite countertops, professional Viking range and garden window overlooking landscaped, fenced in yard. Formal dining room with french doors leading to patio. Living room with wood burning fireplace. Hardwood flooring throughout & central AC. Laundry located on second floor as well as lower level laundry. Ample closet space throughout. Finished basement offers additional space for work out, playroom or recreation. Convenient location just, just moments to shops, restaurants, library, parks, all that Greenwich has to offer and just 0.6 miles to Cos Cob metro north station.",
